# 📘 Regression Algo
This folder contains my learning and practice work on regression algorithms in Machine Learning.

## What I Practiced
- Linear Regression
- Multiple Linear Regression
- Polynomial Regression

## Concepts Covered
- Train-Test Split
- Model Training & Prediction
- Evaluation Metrics (R², MAE, RMSE)
- Basic Data Visualization
- Difference between linear and non-linear relationships

## Notes
This is a learning space where I experiment with different datasets and understand concepts step by step.

The focus here is on building strong fundamentals rather than creating production-level projects.